a deterministic dependency manager for AI-agent capabilities

Usage: ambit <COMMAND>

Commands:
  export       export selected packs as Claude plugins
  init         scaffold ambit.yml, skills/, mcps/, hooks/
  search       search the merged catalog
  resolve      compute the bundle and print it
  why          explain why one item is in the bundle
  install      resolve, write lock, materialize, prune
  status       compare what is installed against what resolve produces
  outdated     check whether any catalog's ref now names a different commit
  update       move catalog pins forward, then install
  prune        remove owned artifacts not in the current bundle
  clean        remove everything ambit owns
  validate     validate everything this project configures, for CI
  doctor       check preconditions, drift, ownership
  audit        scan catalog content for hidden text and risky commands
  self-update  replace this ambit binary with a released one
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
